Placeholders in textFaint and hand-darkened labels in textDim: the theme's own muted and
dark_foreground (spec/tokens.md Roles) instead of Qt.darker(foreground, 1.4-2.0), which in a
light theme is stronger than the text. Upstream candidate: the shell's Color.qml would grow the
same two roles.

--- a/qt/qml/Omarchy/Ui/TextField.qml
+++ b/qt/qml/Omarchy/Ui/TextField.qml
@@ -43,7 +43,7 @@
   color: foreground
   selectionColor: selectionTint
   selectedTextColor: foreground
-  placeholderTextColor: Qt.darker(foreground, 1.6)
+  placeholderTextColor: Commons.Color.textFaint
 
   leftPadding: horizontalPadding + Border.left(_borderSpec)
   rightPadding: horizontalPadding + Border.right(_borderSpec)
